full-query: "An RDS MySQL database is created for a new feature that your team is currently working on. The feature has used the database to save email transaction data for each customer. For the database, automated snapshots have been configured and are working properly. Due to business requirements, the newest snapshot needs to be shared and used in another AWS account. How can you share this automated RDS snapshot?"
